Before Leaving Home

Change into a fresh pad before starting a long journey. Check your bag to make sure you have enough supplies for the entire day.

During the Journey

If you have access to a washroom, use the opportunity to check and change your pad according to your flow.

Do not wait until your pad is completely saturated.

Conclusion

A heavy period does not have to make commuting stressful. Having extra supplies and choosing suitable protection can give you greater peace of mind.

